r bound\nalso equals the optimum on \\texttt{Random-125-125-6-1\\_0} (81) and SP4 (53),\nwhich the search refutes on the full instance within a minute.\n\npaper1/latex/sec4_search.tex:453:\\begin{theorem}[our corrected search is sound]\\label{thm:main}\npaper1/latex/sec4_search.tex:641:\\begin{theorem}[minor monotonicity]\\label{thm:minor}\npaper1/latex/sec9a_appendix_lean.tex:6:\\label{app:lean}\npaper1/latex/sec9b_appendix_machinery.tex:6:\\label{app:machinery-all}","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01HPTCqM2y3U9bksLcKxcPyA","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
